				"readmeComment": "Start, Pause and Stop are sent as `set_mode_withroom` like the Mi Home app does (cleaning type, action, number of rooms). Start uses cleaning type 0 (vacuum); the app derives the type from the `is_mop` channel, use Start vacuum and mop or Start mop for those types. The app pauses with action 2 from its main button (3 in some other flows; python-miio documents 2). Dock sends `set_charge` 1, Cancel return to dock sends `set_charge` 0, Find robot sends `set_resetpos` 1 (the app Find function). Not exposed: room, zone and spot cleaning, virtual walls and map editing (need several values). Value mapping `[\"1\"\u003d\"Start\",\"0\"\u003d\"Stop\",\"2\"\u003d\"Pause\",\"3\"\u003d\"Dock\",\"4\"\u003d\"Cancel return to dock\",\"5\"\u003d\"Start vacuum and mop\",\"6\"\u003d\"Start mop\",\"7\"\u003d\"Find robot\"]`"
			},
